            "notes": "Use your fourth rounder items to counter the enemy team. \n\nEnemy team running a lot of armor? [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) will help punch through that.\n\nEnemy team has a ton of healing? [El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100)\n\nEnemy team has a lot of high HP builds? [Volskaya Ordnance](item_396c0970-daa8-47e3-8049-e65f03fe5cec) is a very potent item against their likes.\n\nEnemy team has a Winston? [Salvaged Slugs](item_019d6c60-36eb-42ec-8d6e-5bbb44a0db61) and pop that bubble.\n\nThree Tap Tommy Gun is great all rounder pick as with the Toxin Tips + Redux combo, you will have incredibly high uptime on it since we want to be spamming dash to have constant uptime on Forager.",
