            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-07T02:01:01.467882+00:00",
            "notes": "At this point, we want a little extra survivability and you can pick between [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) for more life steal or [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) as your Ult will be useless at this point. Vanadium Injection is very potent as Primary Fire Freja enjoys all it's buffs but if you go Phantasmic Flux then it's worth stacking as much lifesteal as possible to exploit it.\n\nPower-wise, not much exciting here. [Volley \u00e0 Deux](item_d4f4d2cb-f4b0-4137-b716-2f5697c2a986) is a good choice now that we have the sustain and mobility to actually live that close where the shotgun like spread can hit. \n\n[Deep Pockets](item_4e5d5d1d-2c0d-4f5e-9521-9f71bdb88e9e) isn't really necessary when the Toxin Tips + Redux combo basically ensures infinite ammo with good aim. \n\nIf you're rich, then go for [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) for more damage and CD reduction or build against the enemy team.\n\n[Portable Zipline](item_f4907cd6-08dc-4a13-b8f8-66d1949d35be) Just isn't worth it. It's highly outclassed in terms of the WP increase and your CD reduction should be so small at this point thanks to Redux that the refresh on Dash's barely matters.",
